          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaamwiramu ati: “Isebantu kyabazinga, eifumo liirino. Omulala ku baisuka k'aidhe alinone ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda asasula buli muntu olw'obutuufu bwe n'obwesigwa bwe. Olwaleero Musengwa Katonda oyo akumpaire mu ngalo dhange, aye nze naaloba kugalula mukono gwange kukola kabi ku oyo Musengwa Katonda ye yasiiga omuzigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona eno, nga nze bwe mponiiza obulamu bwo olwaleero, ni Musengwa Katonda k'awonie obwange era ambisenga mu bizibu byonabyona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
